<description>&lt;p&gt;Mexican authorities indicted a man for building a cross-border drug tunnel used by a cartel, while roadblocks in Matamoros were set up after the son of a Gulf Cartel leader was detained, disrupting traffic. In the United States, a man with alleged cartel ties shot at a U.S. marshal, and federal agents arrested nine suspects linked to the Sinaloa Cartel in a California train cargo theft and charged 24 individuals in a Middle Tennessee drug ring. Homeland Security also indicted 24 people in a cartel-linked scheme, and a federal raid targeted cartel hubs in Wilson County, Tennessee. 37 battle-related deaths in 1996, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;NBC Los Angeles&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizAFBVV95cUxNeDBMVzNIUHc2OFlBRVRaUDFseTBOWElUcVdBNzh5cHNDaHBuS1hnVm1CWFBuemNLZUdGS3NmMlZibzgyc1NubkRiUV9wUnExVUpmNEN1Ym52TG96SU1XM1psVWJVREtJem9KRWVVZnhhODVpdHRabldZSzRJNTZPWnRiUS1MaFZncDJfSTc0SUJlcDZRWnJyNlZEcDA2MnZCc245MWotMmt3dzBMcGdmU3V3OTVyLUNORWhkWGxiVmxIVmkzR1FUM1hvSWc?oc=5&quot;&gt;UA.NEWS&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV95cUxOR1dxWWdMb1M1N1AwUDktMDc1Q3BMQ1FtSTB3VEdXWWFLNTJjMTJEOHduaTdFd2xNbW5KV1hLU3dLR3VMYmstLTk2YkxnaXNtMzg2ZnYxcFZtZV9kWDVnS0NsZEhtN3BHc1h4bUdrc0J1dUYxbEFpRm1SQ2FGejh1cTlaUFQ5alEtVEhrdzZuS19TU0J0OWc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Mexico News Daily&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Belleville News-Democrat&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxNanRjVXlzQ1hDajRLOXgwcnF4allHbmlnbjUzVENncGJnb0ZqaFF0bzdFcTh4VER4d1c2ZzdDeFV5T05RU0ZXN3NFZVQzOFpMc1hITzJBTDRvYXN0LUMzcGU0VkJmN1RzdFJnQVdFS3h3VWphT1pJMy1IMmJZbk9lVF9yQVdXZjN6X2FrUy1VaTNmUG9VTjZmWENMc1Y?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles